# Source-only repository: scripts, docs, project config and small data files.
# Unreal binary assets (incl. licensed Fab / Epic / MetaHuman content), source art and media stay local.

# --- Unreal generated / per-machine ---
claude_ue5/Binaries/
claude_ue5/DerivedDataCache/
claude_ue5/Intermediate/
claude_ue5/Saved/
claude_ue5/Build/
*.sln
*.VC.db
.vs/

# --- Unreal assets (Content holds licensed third-party packs; rebuilt by pipeline/ from local packs) ---
claude_ue5/Content/
*.uasset
*.umap
*.ubulk
*.uexp
*.upk

# --- Source art binaries (regenerated by pipeline/blender_numpy) ---
